{
  "_comment": "Template. Put this at .claude/settings.json in your project. Replace GMAIL_CONNECTOR_ID and CALENDAR_CONNECTOR_ID with the ids your own Claude shows for your connectors (tool names look like mcp__<id>__search_threads). Delete the _comment line before use. The deny list is the safety net: do not remove entries from it. Canvas: replace the CANVAS_SERVER_NAME placeholders with your Canvas MCP server's real name and its read-only and write tool names.",
